 I cannot create an HTML page directly for you, but I can provide you with an example of how to achieve this using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Please note that accessing a user's desktop background image requires permission and is not possible through client-side JavaScript due to privacy concerns. However, I will provide you with an example using a local image file as a substitute.

